 "title": "Properties of constructible-boundary separation",
 "statement": "The constructed blow-up $\\mathsf{CSepBl}_U(T_1,T_2)\\to X$ is\n$U$-admissible, and the closures of the inverse images of $T_1$ and $T_2$\nare disjoint.",
 "source": {
